{
  "date": "2026-11-19",
  "category": "fintech",
  "title_zh": "腾讯第三季度：金融科技和企业服务收入达到637亿元",
  "title_en": "Tencent Q3: Revenue from fintech and business services reaches 63.7 billion yuan",
  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "zh": "11月18日，腾讯公布了2026年第三季度的业绩。这个季度，腾讯的总收入约为2073亿元，比去年同期增长8%。",
      "en": "On November 18, Tencent released its results for the third quarter of 2026. In this quarter, Tencent's total revenue was about 207.3 billion yuan, up 8% from the same period last year."
    },
    {
      "zh": "在腾讯的财报里，金融科技和企业服务算作同一个业务。这个季度，这部分收入约为637亿元，比去年同期增长9%。腾讯表示，这部分收入变多，主要是因为云服务和商业支付服务赚的钱增加了。其中，云服务的收入比去年同期增长了35%。",
      "en": "In Tencent's financial report, fintech and business services count as one business segment. This quarter, revenue from this segment was about 63.7 billion yuan, up 9% from the same period last year. Tencent said this revenue rose mainly because it earned more from cloud services and commercial payment services. Of these, cloud services revenue grew 35% from a year earlier."
    },
    {
      "zh": "腾讯的金融科技服务包括微信支付。很多人每天用微信支付扫码付款，或者给朋友转账。",
      "en": "Tencent's fintech services include WeChat Pay. Many people use WeChat Pay every day to scan QR codes to pay, or to transfer money to friends."
    },
    {
      "zh": "截至9月底，微信和WeChat每月的活跃账户合计约有14.49亿个，比去年同期多了2%。WeChat是微信的国际版本。",
      "en": "As of the end of September, Weixin and WeChat together had about 1.449 billion monthly active accounts, 2% more than a year earlier. WeChat is the international version of Weixin."
    }
  ],
  "source": {
    "name": "移动支付网",
    "name_en": "Mpaypass (China Mobile Payment Network)",
